OL,3,GNEWSAPedestrian seriously injured as   
OL,4,Atwo cars crash                         
OL,6,FA pedestrian has been taken to hospital
OL,7,Fwith serious injuries after a crash    
OL,8,Finvolving two cars in Peterborough.    
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to      
OL,11,FBourges Boulevard, near Maskew Avenue, 
OL,12,Fshortly after 14:30 GMT after reports  
OL,13,Fof a collision involving two vehicles. 
OL,15,FCambridgeshire Police said the         
OL,16,Fpedestrian's injuries were serious, but
OL,17,Fwere not believed to be                
OL,18,Flife-threatening.                      
OL,23,APub: 25-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
